image	Run docker/build-push-action@v6	2026-10-10T14:24:52.5588991Z             "body": "## Phase 21: Browser Test of the Viewer\n\nDraft opened by plan 21-08 so `ubuntu-latest` runs the admitted suite (`test (3.12)`) on the phase branch — SC5. The full PR body is generated at ship time (`/gsd-ship`), after verification.\n\nWhat the branch carries: a real headless browser (`playwright==1.63.0`, Chrome Headless Shell under `.venv/ms-playwright`) inside `make verify` and CI, proving the form builds from `/api/schema`, an invalid field is marked, a warning renders, the first STL is drawn, every link field round-trips, and the request each of the 44 fixture records sends is pinned (`tests/regression/golden_requests.json`). Fails closed when the shell is missing. Priced on this host and accepted (`bench/RESULTS.md`, `### The browser test, priced (21-07)`).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
